# Optional. Per-account launchers that T3 Code (or another app) runs as a provider's binary
# path, e.g. an OpenCode wrapper that meters one account's usage. t3-check maps an instance
# whose binaryPath is listed here to that profile; unlisted OpenCode instances are reported
# as unmapped and unmetered. Listing a wrapper does not guard folders.
# binary-path	profile
~/bin/opencode-globex	globex
